WEBVTT

00:11.640 --> 00:12.080
Bowen,

00:13.190 --> 00:15.390
how long are you going to hide it from me?

00:16.160 --> 00:17.090
What do you mean?

00:20.000 --> 00:21.760
That day when Zhou Rong came to our house,

00:21.760 --> 00:23.120
I saw everything from the stairs—

00:23.120 --> 00:24.230
he was going to pull out a gun
to kill you.

00:24.230 --> 00:25.280
I almost rushed in

00:25.280 --> 00:26.080
to fight them.

00:32.240 --> 00:34.000
This is what they call "brothers are

00:34.000 --> 00:35.660
the best partners in a fight."

00:36.280 --> 00:37.940
My love for you wasn't in vain.

00:40.240 --> 00:41.970
Our parents passed away early.

00:42.000 --> 00:43.350
You raised me alone.

00:44.030 --> 00:45.790
You earned our family's success today

00:45.790 --> 00:46.640
by risking your life

00:46.640 --> 00:47.670
and fighting for it

00:47.670 --> 00:49.000
through thick and thin.

00:49.600 --> 00:50.520
I know you don't want me

00:50.520 --> 00:51.410
to be like you.

00:52.000 --> 00:53.290
You want me to succeed in my studies.

00:53.290 --> 00:54.120
All my efforts

00:54.150 --> 00:55.470
are for this goal.

00:58.350 --> 00:59.880
And my painstaking efforts

01:00.670 --> 01:01.930
haven't gone to waste.

01:02.380 --> 01:02.980
Yangyang,

01:03.470 --> 01:05.000
when you finish your studies,

01:05.000 --> 01:06.560
all the wealth I've built

01:06.560 --> 01:07.360
will be yours.

01:07.710 --> 01:08.990
By then, you'll have both a diploma

01:08.990 --> 01:09.700
and wealth.

01:10.039 --> 01:11.310
Flocks of girls

01:11.310 --> 01:12.430
will be chasing after you.

01:12.430 --> 01:14.160
Bowen, I don't need any of that.

01:14.560 --> 01:16.160
But I can't live without you.

01:17.480 --> 01:18.510
You are the only family

01:18.510 --> 01:19.640
I have in this world.

01:24.510 --> 01:25.640
Mr. Rong came to meet you that day

01:25.640 --> 01:26.810
because the police were investigating

01:26.810 --> 01:28.140
Lu Zheng's case, right?

01:28.760 --> 01:29.510
On his birthday,

01:29.510 --> 01:30.590
I heard everything

01:30.590 --> 01:31.400
you guys said

01:31.400 --> 01:32.350
in the wine cellar.

01:32.350 --> 01:34.070
I'm afraid... I'm afraid
the police will trace it to you,

01:34.070 --> 01:34.509
Bowen!

01:34.840 --> 01:35.570
Don't worry.

01:36.070 --> 01:37.150
There is nothing in Sanjiangkou

01:37.150 --> 01:38.590
that I, your brother, can't handle.

01:38.590 --> 01:39.560
Your mission right now

01:39.560 --> 01:41.560
is to focus on applying for college.

01:42.920 --> 01:43.710
And then,

01:44.310 --> 01:45.310
go abroad

01:45.400 --> 01:47.060
and find someone with a high IQ

01:47.070 --> 01:47.789
to improve

01:47.789 --> 01:49.350
our Lang family's genes.

01:49.789 --> 01:51.450
Someone with a low IQ won't do.

03:15.910 --> 03:19.610
[Born with Luck]

03:19.650 --> 03:22.570
[Episode 12]

03:25.470 --> 03:26.190
Ren!

03:27.430 --> 03:28.750
What's up so early?

03:30.150 --> 03:31.550
You're looking for Yibo?

03:32.960 --> 03:34.400
He's not with me.

03:36.860 --> 03:37.480
Okay.

03:43.400 --> 03:45.329
Hu Jianren is already downstairs.

03:46.710 --> 03:48.000
Zhou Rong wanted to see me

03:48.000 --> 03:49.930
and sent him to pick me up in person.

04:03.430 --> 04:04.870
Can we get through this?

04:31.070 --> 04:31.530
Take it.

04:32.310 --> 04:33.110
Don't hang up.

04:33.870 --> 04:34.600
If I say,

04:34.800 --> 04:36.000
"I don't know anything about it.

04:36.000 --> 04:37.130
Please go ask Yibo,"

04:37.750 --> 04:39.409
call the police immediately.

04:41.250 --> 04:42.580
I know Zhou Rong so well.

04:43.050 --> 04:44.390
This is way too risky.

04:44.830 --> 04:46.090
Is there any other way?

04:48.710 --> 04:50.510
If he dares to do anything to you,

04:50.510 --> 04:52.310
I'll fight him to the bitter end.

05:02.360 --> 05:03.020
I'm coming.

05:06.820 --> 05:08.820
Ren, sorry to have kept you waiting.

05:47.980 --> 05:50.020
[Waiting]

06:47.930 --> 06:49.470
[Jiafu Digital Store]

07:07.840 --> 07:08.410
Come in.

07:18.510 --> 07:19.040
Welcome.

07:24.750 --> 07:25.430
Mr. Rong.

07:25.970 --> 07:27.510
Let me introduce a new friend to you.

07:27.510 --> 07:27.970
Come on.

07:30.070 --> 07:30.600
Sit down.

07:32.360 --> 07:33.870
Mr. Rong told you to sit down.

07:33.870 --> 07:34.240
I...

07:34.800 --> 07:36.530
Don't be afraid. Just sit down.

07:39.600 --> 07:40.040
Sit.

07:41.390 --> 07:42.250
Take your seat.

07:45.870 --> 07:46.800
Don't be afraid.

07:47.240 --> 07:48.750
As long as you tell the truth,

07:48.750 --> 07:50.210
there won't be any danger.

07:53.190 --> 07:54.920
I promise I will tell the truth.

07:55.040 --> 07:55.760
I heard

07:55.830 --> 07:57.950
that the police
went to ask you about it again.

07:57.950 --> 07:58.630
Recall carefully

07:58.630 --> 07:59.560
what they asked.

07:59.920 --> 08:01.520
Don't leave out any details.

08:03.630 --> 08:04.750
I... I...

08:15.630 --> 08:16.560
Based on the latest information

08:16.560 --> 08:17.430
we have,

08:17.870 --> 08:19.190
Captain Ye did go to Fenglinwan

08:19.190 --> 08:20.390
before the accident.

08:22.240 --> 08:23.310
We asked Lu Yibo.

08:23.430 --> 08:24.090
He said that

08:24.160 --> 08:25.960
when Captain Ye went to meet him,

08:26.160 --> 08:27.890
he also asked about this watch.

08:28.070 --> 08:28.920
So,

08:30.070 --> 08:31.390
Captain Ye also noticed

08:31.390 --> 08:33.030
something fishy about this watch.

08:32.799 --> 08:33.950
[Checked the cases handled by Lu Zheng]
[Drunk driving inspection] [Murdered]

08:34.789 --> 08:36.990
Could it be related to Chief Lu's death?

08:37.030 --> 08:38.429
It can't be verified yet.

08:43.760 --> 08:44.560
[Waiting] [Speaker]

08:43.960 --> 08:46.160
I explained the jewelry thing clearly.

08:48.200 --> 08:50.480
But they kept asking

08:52.180 --> 08:54.180
if Captain Ye had been to Fenglinwan

08:54.360 --> 08:55.830
before the accident.

08:56.600 --> 08:57.800
What did you say then?

08:58.720 --> 08:59.360
I didn't know

08:59.360 --> 09:00.570
what they wanted.

09:01.150 --> 09:02.910
So when I was at the police station,

09:02.910 --> 09:04.510
I didn't say he had been here.

09:04.870 --> 09:06.000
I said I didn't know.

09:10.120 --> 09:10.780
That's all?

09:13.390 --> 09:14.360
Think again.

09:16.200 --> 09:16.800
The watch.

09:17.820 --> 09:18.800
About the watch.

09:19.960 --> 09:20.720
What watch?

09:21.670 --> 09:23.390
They a-asked about the watch

09:23.390 --> 09:24.720
that Bowen gave to Yibo.

09:26.600 --> 09:27.440
But this watch was

09:27.440 --> 09:28.790
not purchased by Lu Yibo himself.

09:28.790 --> 09:29.550
It was Lang Bowen

09:28.880 --> 09:31.270
[Zhou Rong] [Hu Jianren] [Lang Bowen]

09:29.550 --> 09:30.670
who lost it to him when they were

09:30.670 --> 09:31.530
playing a game.

09:31.960 --> 09:32.960
Then it might be

09:33.000 --> 09:34.260
related to Lang Bowen.

09:34.720 --> 09:35.320
Captain Wang and I

09:35.320 --> 09:36.650
deduced the same thing.

09:37.210 --> 09:37.840
However,

09:38.000 --> 09:39.110
Lu Yibo told us

09:39.390 --> 09:41.390
that Lang Bowen lost this watch

09:41.080 --> 09:42.360
[Zhou Rong] [Hu Jianren] [Lang Bowen]

09:41.410 --> 09:42.480
to him a year ago.

09:43.150 --> 09:44.390
A year ago,

09:45.320 --> 09:46.720
Chief Lu was still alive.

09:46.910 --> 09:47.460
Yeah.

09:48.960 --> 09:50.200
So now all of this

09:51.080 --> 09:52.720
is pointing to Lu Yibo again.

09:52.140 --> 09:52.750
[General Manager of Fenglinwan Hotel]

09:52.770 --> 09:53.360
[PR Manager of Fenglinwan Nightclub]

09:53.470 --> 09:54.120
It's so important,

09:54.120 --> 09:55.360
and you are only telling me now?

09:55.360 --> 09:56.000
Mr. Rong.

09:56.480 --> 09:57.030
Mr. Rong.

09:57.550 --> 09:58.840
Yibo is actually

09:58.840 --> 10:00.140
very loyal to you.

10:00.200 --> 10:01.320
If he's so loyal,

10:01.320 --> 10:02.980
why didn't he tell us earlier?

10:04.500 --> 10:05.720
I don't know anything.

10:05.720 --> 10:07.280
Please go ask Yibo.

10:08.310 --> 10:10.650
[Chief Zhang Yi'ang
of the Municipal Bureau]

10:13.870 --> 10:14.600
It's Lu Yibo.

10:16.630 --> 10:17.030
Hello?

10:17.170 --> 10:17.900
Chief Zhang,

10:18.420 --> 10:19.820
this is Lu Yibo speaking.

10:20.320 --> 10:21.650
I want to confess to you.

10:21.790 --> 10:22.440
Good.

10:23.360 --> 10:24.240
What do you want to confess?

10:24.240 --> 10:24.600
Go ahead.

10:24.600 --> 10:25.530
I confess to you.

10:25.600 --> 10:26.400
I'll tell you.

10:26.570 --> 10:28.230
Confess what? I'm listening.

10:28.320 --> 10:29.440
I'll tell you everything.

10:29.440 --> 10:30.280
I know.

10:31.000 --> 10:31.860
Take your time.

10:33.840 --> 10:35.740
The night Lu Zheng died,

10:36.510 --> 10:38.600
Bowen was wearing that watch.

10:40.510 --> 10:42.110
Later, he gave it to Yibo.

10:42.600 --> 10:44.660
Yibo was afraid of being implicated,

10:45.270 --> 10:46.790
so he asked me to throw the watch away.

10:46.790 --> 10:48.190
I didn't dare to tell you.

10:49.910 --> 10:50.600
Mr. Rong,

10:50.840 --> 10:52.300
I'll go bring Lu Yibo here.

10:52.360 --> 10:53.360
If you can't do it,

10:53.390 --> 10:54.030
I will.

10:54.510 --> 10:55.320
Mr. Rong!

10:55.750 --> 10:57.420
You can't do this to Yibo.

10:57.630 --> 10:58.910
Yibo already confessed

10:58.910 --> 11:00.750
that before Lu Zheng died,

11:00.750 --> 11:02.880
Bowen had already given him the watch.

11:05.870 --> 11:06.800
What do you mean?

11:08.840 --> 11:10.320
Y-Yibo knew he had let you down before,

11:10.320 --> 11:11.320
Mr. Rong,

11:12.480 --> 11:14.480
so he took it all on himself.

11:15.440 --> 11:16.960
The police won't be able
to trace it to Bowen

11:16.960 --> 11:18.440
or to you.

11:19.000 --> 11:20.670
Even if they trace it to you,

11:21.480 --> 11:23.540
he has already taken the fall for you.

11:30.960 --> 11:31.630
Verify this matter

11:31.630 --> 11:32.670
with that bastard.

11:32.670 --> 11:33.120
Yes.

11:35.630 --> 11:36.080
Hello?

11:36.520 --> 11:37.780
[Chief Zhang Yi'ang
of the Municipal Bureau]

11:38.150 --> 11:38.630
Hello?

11:40.870 --> 11:42.130
What's this all about?

11:42.670 --> 11:43.960
Is he playing with us?

11:48.560 --> 11:51.060
[Chief Zhang Yi'ang
of the Municipal Bureau]

12:25.390 --> 12:25.840
Ren.

12:33.510 --> 12:34.790
What are you doing here?

12:34.790 --> 12:35.200
I...

12:37.720 --> 12:39.840
I've always wanted to learn photography.

12:39.840 --> 12:41.240
So I came to buy some gear.

12:44.900 --> 12:46.120
I have a question for you.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.050
Please go ahead.

12:49.870 --> 12:50.400
Who is it?

12:50.720 --> 12:51.240
Nobody.

12:54.960 --> 12:55.620
Take it out.

12:57.000 --> 12:58.200
Really, it's nobody.

13:10.380 --> 13:12.160
[Chief Zhang Yi'ang
of the Municipal Bureau]

13:10.790 --> 13:11.650
I don't know why

13:11.670 --> 13:12.900
he's calling me.

13:16.230 --> 13:17.600
You tailed us here.

13:20.360 --> 13:20.840
Ren,

13:21.390 --> 13:22.720
it's not what you think.

13:23.240 --> 13:24.170
It really isn't.

13:27.030 --> 13:27.510
Mr. Lu,

13:28.030 --> 13:28.770
what do you

13:28.960 --> 13:29.690
mean by this?

13:31.510 --> 13:32.030
Ren,

13:32.390 --> 13:33.990
please don't talk like that.

13:34.360 --> 13:36.040
You can either hit me or scold me.

13:36.040 --> 13:37.240
You being this polite

13:37.360 --> 13:38.120
scares me.

13:39.720 --> 13:40.390
Mr. Lu.

13:41.150 --> 13:41.630
Mr. Lu.

13:42.720 --> 13:43.720
Ren, Ren.

13:44.840 --> 13:45.240
You...

13:45.300 --> 13:47.000
You can interrogate me inside.

13:47.000 --> 13:48.240
Let's go inside to talk.

13:48.240 --> 13:49.360
If you think I'm lying,

13:49.360 --> 13:50.000
you can kill me inside,

13:50.000 --> 13:51.360
and no one will see it, right?

13:51.360 --> 13:51.980
Let's go inside and talk.

13:51.980 --> 13:52.480
Ren,

13:52.550 --> 13:53.720
let's g-go inside.

13:53.960 --> 13:54.420
Come on.

13:54.720 --> 13:55.440
After you.

13:59.720 --> 14:00.520
Stay outside.

14:08.550 --> 14:09.720
Qi came over today,

14:10.750 --> 14:12.550
and you knew
what Mr. Rong wanted to ask her,

14:12.550 --> 14:13.680
so you followed her.

14:14.240 --> 14:15.360
If anything happened to Qi,

14:15.360 --> 14:16.620
you'd call the police,

14:16.840 --> 14:17.390
right?

14:22.240 --> 14:23.630
Mr. Rong hates people

14:23.630 --> 14:25.430
who are disloyal to him the most.

14:28.440 --> 14:29.000
Ren.

14:30.540 --> 14:32.200
As long as you don't tell Mr. Rong,

14:32.200 --> 14:33.600
I'll do anything you ask.

14:37.300 --> 14:38.920
I'm afraid of Mr. Rong, too.

14:39.980 --> 14:41.710
I don't dare to hide it from him.

14:46.480 --> 14:47.000
Ren,

14:47.520 --> 14:54.400
[Security Office Management System]

14:49.750 --> 14:51.870
the God of Wealth statue
you got for Mr. Rong

14:51.870 --> 14:53.330
wasn't that price, right?

14:56.360 --> 14:57.120
Zheng Yongbing is

14:57.120 --> 14:58.520
a regular at Fenglinwan.

15:00.080 --> 15:00.960
These past couple of years,

15:00.960 --> 15:03.510
you've handled everything big or small
in Rongcheng.

15:03.510 --> 15:05.440
You must've raked in a lot of money.

15:08.460 --> 15:09.670
Mr. Rong hates people

15:09.670 --> 15:11.470
who are disloyal to him the most.

15:17.790 --> 15:19.120
Are you threatening me?

15:21.000 --> 15:22.480
How would I have that audacity?

15:22.480 --> 15:23.150
Ren,

15:23.720 --> 15:25.720
the police already know about this.

15:26.960 --> 15:27.480
Really?

15:28.480 --> 15:29.670
T-There's another thing

15:29.670 --> 15:31.730
I haven't dared to report to Mr. Rong.

15:33.080 --> 15:33.740
Out with it!

15:37.120 --> 15:38.630
On the night Ye Jian died,

15:39.440 --> 15:40.900
he actually came to see me.

15:53.720 --> 15:54.450
Apparently,

15:55.750 --> 15:56.840
Lu Yibo's psychological defense

15:56.840 --> 15:57.700
has collapsed.

15:57.960 --> 15:59.030
If he calls again,

16:00.150 --> 16:02.410
he will definitely confess everything.

16:05.790 --> 16:07.190
Why hasn't he called yet?

16:14.700 --> 16:16.340
[Lu Yibo]

16:27.550 --> 16:27.960
Hello?

16:28.200 --> 16:28.930
Chief Zhang,

16:29.270 --> 16:29.870
sorry,

16:30.320 --> 16:31.450
I was drunk just now.

16:31.790 --> 16:32.650
You were drunk?

16:33.080 --> 16:34.680
Is something bothering you?

16:35.480 --> 16:37.320
You guys have been coming
too often lately.

16:37.320 --> 16:38.390
Under too much stress,

16:38.390 --> 16:39.600
I just spoke out of turn.

16:39.600 --> 16:41.130
It's okay now, Chief Zhang.

16:56.870 --> 16:57.630
Lu Yibo, don't talk.

16:57.630 --> 16:58.150
Don't talk.

16:58.150 --> 16:58.880
Listen to me.

16:59.910 --> 17:00.960
Cooperating with the police

17:00.960 --> 17:02.350
is your only way out now.

17:02.870 --> 17:03.600
I'll hang up.

17:04.920 --> 17:06.069
You shouldn't have stopped him
from talking.

17:06.069 --> 17:06.920
He didn't confess yet,

17:06.920 --> 17:07.829
and you just hung up?

17:07.829 --> 17:08.690
He's a drunkard

17:09.270 --> 17:10.270
full of nonsense.

17:10.920 --> 17:12.160
I'm not giving him another chance.

17:12.160 --> 17:13.720
We will investigate it ourselves.

17:13.720 --> 17:14.450
Chief Zhang,

17:14.550 --> 17:15.480
so charismatic.

17:15.920 --> 17:16.680
There must be

17:16.680 --> 17:17.960
some shady business going on.

17:17.960 --> 17:18.510
How should we

17:18.510 --> 17:19.710
investigate Lu Yibo?

17:21.720 --> 17:22.920
I believe we can do it.

17:31.200 --> 17:31.550
What?

17:31.790 --> 17:32.300
Wait,

17:32.350 --> 17:33.720
you even eat medicine?

17:34.440 --> 17:35.700
Who are you talking to?

17:36.310 --> 17:37.510
I'm talking to the dog.

17:37.510 --> 17:38.680
Mr. Rong, I'm talking to it.

17:38.680 --> 17:39.880
I'm scolding the dog.

17:39.920 --> 17:41.650
I'm scolding the dog, Mr. Rong.

17:43.350 --> 17:44.810
Take it to have some water.

17:52.070 --> 17:53.400
So Lu Yibo said

17:53.850 --> 17:54.880
that night, Ye Jian

17:54.880 --> 17:56.610
just asked him about the watch?

17:57.780 --> 17:58.910
That's what he said.

17:59.480 --> 18:00.680
Do you think this has

18:00.680 --> 18:02.410
anything to do with Ye's death?

18:04.640 --> 18:05.240
My first instinct

18:05.240 --> 18:06.840
was definitely still Bowen.

18:07.750 --> 18:08.680
But it doesn't seem like him.

18:08.680 --> 18:09.880
If it really were him,

18:10.000 --> 18:10.590
he wouldn't have

18:10.590 --> 18:12.250
a reason to swear at gunpoint.

18:12.400 --> 18:13.460
What about Lu Yibo?

18:14.070 --> 18:14.920
Look at what a coward he is.

18:14.920 --> 18:15.920
He wouldn't dare.

18:16.030 --> 18:17.030
I mean, about Lu Yibo,

18:17.030 --> 18:18.030
what should we do?

18:21.030 --> 18:23.160
The police are investigating him now.

18:23.590 --> 18:24.350
That means

18:24.880 --> 18:26.810
they haven't found anything on us.

18:27.000 --> 18:28.400
If we do something to him,

18:30.070 --> 18:31.930
we're simply asking for trouble.

18:34.590 --> 18:35.200
Mr. Rong,

18:35.590 --> 18:36.750
forgive me for speaking out of turn,

18:36.750 --> 18:37.590
but I feel like

18:38.160 --> 18:39.480
ever since Ye died,

18:39.480 --> 18:41.830
things have gotten
more and more complicated.

18:41.830 --> 18:43.430
We really need to be careful.

18:44.880 --> 18:46.210
We do need to be careful.

18:48.000 --> 18:50.000
You tell me what to do, and I'll do it.

18:51.270 --> 18:52.070
You go first.

18:52.510 --> 18:54.110
Tell Bowen to come over here.

18:54.480 --> 18:54.920
Okay.

19:17.550 --> 19:18.240
Didn't we already

19:18.240 --> 19:19.680
go through the Taobao records once again?

19:19.680 --> 19:21.340
What else are you looking for?

19:23.680 --> 19:24.640
I want to know why Captain Ye

19:23.860 --> 19:24.550
[Vintage square student
male waterproof digital watch]

19:24.640 --> 19:26.100
investigated this watch.

19:26.350 --> 19:27.950
Captain Ye grew up with them.

19:28.680 --> 19:29.200
He might have

19:29.200 --> 19:30.530
seen this watch before.

19:30.590 --> 19:32.390
Then why did he go to Fenglinwan?

19:32.830 --> 19:33.830
How should I know?

19:36.480 --> 19:38.010
Why did he go to Fenglinwan?

19:39.640 --> 19:40.720
Why did he go?

19:43.960 --> 19:44.880
Captain Ye

19:45.000 --> 19:46.270
also came to review files yesterday?

19:46.270 --> 19:46.590
Yes.

19:48.030 --> 19:49.350
What kind of cases were they?

19:49.350 --> 19:50.350
Cases that Chief Lu was involved in

19:50.350 --> 19:52.030
the year before he passed away.

19:52.030 --> 19:53.360
They are all right here.

19:55.400 --> 19:57.260
Why did he want to check the files?

19:59.200 --> 20:00.490
Because he found something.

20:00.490 --> 20:02.670
[File Management System
of Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

20:00.550 --> 20:01.480
What did he find?

20:02.070 --> 20:03.240
So what did he find?

20:03.270 --> 20:04.670
What exactly did he find?

20:05.190 --> 20:07.710
[Anzhi Road, Sanjiangkou City,
Ping'an Province]

20:16.270 --> 20:17.350
I remember Captain Ye

20:17.350 --> 20:18.270
asked me to enlarge and enhance

20:18.270 --> 20:19.330
an image back then.

20:20.240 --> 20:22.310
Zhang, I'm sending you a picture.

20:23.110 --> 20:24.710
Enlarge it and make it clear.

20:27.790 --> 20:29.320
It seems to be just this one.

20:29.510 --> 20:30.570
Where is the image?

20:30.720 --> 20:31.720
Let me look for it.

20:42.440 --> 20:44.100
The truth is about to come out.

20:44.520 --> 20:45.220
Sorry.

20:49.010 --> 20:50.700
[Century Otto]

20:54.880 --> 20:55.350
Bowen!

20:56.200 --> 20:56.680
Bowen!

20:57.640 --> 20:58.440
Stop yelling.

20:58.880 --> 21:00.210
Let me finish this game.

21:11.240 --> 21:13.200
Dear Mr. Botu Lang,

21:13.550 --> 21:14.240
Reply:

21:14.310 --> 21:15.920
NHHU University

21:15.920 --> 21:16.790
Admission Notice.

21:16.790 --> 21:18.110
I know you are a straight-A student.

21:18.110 --> 21:19.640
Stop showing off before me.

21:19.880 --> 21:21.880
The Senate of NHHU

21:21.880 --> 21:23.030
University

21:23.030 --> 21:24.200
has offered you

21:24.440 --> 21:25.680
the opportunity

21:25.680 --> 21:26.350
to pursue...

21:26.350 --> 21:27.550
Alright, I know you're good at English.

21:27.550 --> 21:28.160
Happy now?

21:29.920 --> 21:30.350
Bowen.

21:32.400 --> 21:33.270
Lang Bowen!

21:34.480 --> 21:36.070
I've been accepted for a master's program

21:36.070 --> 21:37.470
at a foreign university!

21:41.160 --> 21:41.920
Pardon?

21:42.680 --> 21:45.030
I've been admitted to a foreign university

21:45.030 --> 21:46.360
for a master's program.

21:50.310 --> 21:51.370
Which university?

21:51.440 --> 21:54.040
Southern New Hampshire
Mountain University.

22:00.750 --> 22:01.270
You,

22:01.550 --> 22:02.400
Lang Botu,

22:04.070 --> 22:06.330
got admitted to an American university?

22:07.350 --> 22:08.030
You don't believe it?

22:08.030 --> 22:09.200
Could I be lying to you,

22:09.200 --> 22:09.680
Bowen?

22:25.510 --> 22:26.030
Bowen.

22:28.240 --> 22:28.770
I'm okay.

22:29.440 --> 22:30.500
I'm just too happy.

22:35.400 --> 22:36.000
You...

22:36.400 --> 22:39.130
You really brought honor
to our Lang family! I...

22:39.920 --> 22:41.070
And I didn't fail

22:41.070 --> 22:42.070
our parents' entrustment.

22:42.070 --> 22:43.510
I didn't lead you astray.

22:52.440 --> 22:52.880
Hello.

22:52.620 --> 22:54.840
[Century Otto]

22:53.200 --> 22:55.060
We're looking for Mr. Lang Bowen.

22:56.200 --> 22:56.790
Mr. Lang?

22:57.240 --> 22:58.310
Do you have an appointment?

22:58.310 --> 22:59.440
He's here, isn't he?

23:01.070 --> 23:02.240
Whether he's here or not,

23:02.240 --> 23:03.240
Mr. Lang doesn't see guests

23:03.240 --> 23:04.640
without an appointment.

23:05.830 --> 23:06.310
Hello,

23:06.960 --> 23:07.750
I am the Deputy Chief

23:07.750 --> 23:09.270
of Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau.

23:09.270 --> 23:10.750
We need to ask Mr. Lang some questions.

23:10.750 --> 23:12.720
Could you set up an appointment for me?

23:12.720 --> 23:14.610
Come on, you're a grown man.

23:15.510 --> 23:16.440
I'm just happy.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.200
Let's go to the cemetery.

23:19.200 --> 23:20.310
Let's go to the cemetery right now.

23:20.310 --> 23:20.960
We must tell

23:20.960 --> 23:22.200
this good news to Mom and Dad in person.

23:22.200 --> 23:22.640
Okay.

23:26.270 --> 23:27.440
Hear me out first.

23:28.200 --> 23:28.930
Have someone

23:29.440 --> 23:31.640
drive the car to the front immediately.

23:32.310 --> 23:32.830
What?

23:33.510 --> 23:36.000
Tell whoever is looking for me today
to get lost.

23:36.000 --> 23:37.460
Mr. Lang, it's the police.

23:40.680 --> 23:41.540
Call him again.

23:42.240 --> 23:43.440
Well, how about this?

23:43.480 --> 23:44.270
Call him again.

23:44.270 --> 23:45.070
Tell him

23:45.100 --> 23:46.000
that if he's really busy,

23:46.000 --> 23:48.330
we'll meet at the Public Security Bureau.

23:49.680 --> 23:50.070
Lili,

23:50.310 --> 23:50.880
well,

23:51.000 --> 23:52.590
I'll get changed myself today.

23:52.590 --> 23:53.960
And go help me

23:54.000 --> 23:54.930
order 2 wreaths.

23:55.000 --> 23:56.440
Get the most beautiful ones.

23:56.440 --> 23:57.830
And write on the couplet:

23:57.830 --> 23:59.830
Lang Bowen fulfilled his mission.

24:01.070 --> 24:03.310
Lang Botu brought honor to the family.

24:03.720 --> 24:04.270
How nice.

24:05.720 --> 24:06.580
Okay, Mr. Lang.

24:06.680 --> 24:07.240
I'll go right now.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.970
Get me the most beautiful ones,

24:09.680 --> 24:10.810
as beautiful as you.

24:15.550 --> 24:17.210
Didn't I tell them to get lost?

24:17.830 --> 24:18.690
Listen to me...

24:21.790 --> 24:23.500
Why didn't you say it earlier?

24:24.440 --> 24:25.370
Let them come up.

24:31.750 --> 24:32.350
Lili,

24:32.880 --> 24:34.260
don't go buy the wreaths yet.

24:34.260 --> 24:35.510
First, go to the elevator

24:35.510 --> 24:37.240
and pick up some friends for me.

24:38.310 --> 24:39.310
What's up, Bowen?

24:40.240 --> 24:40.770
Nothing.

24:41.640 --> 24:42.720
You... You should also go home

24:42.720 --> 24:43.850
to change into something more formal.

24:43.850 --> 24:45.110
We'll go see Mom and Dad later.

24:45.110 --> 24:46.270
After I'm done here,

24:46.270 --> 24:47.800
I'll go back and pick you up.

24:51.780 --> 24:54.200
[Century Otto]

24:53.030 --> 24:54.030
This way, please.

24:59.310 --> 24:59.840
This way.

25:04.350 --> 25:05.110
Hello, Chief Zhang.

25:05.110 --> 25:06.110
Hello, officers.

25:07.640 --> 25:08.550
You're Lang Bowen's younger brother,

25:08.550 --> 25:09.550
Lang Botu, right?

25:09.680 --> 25:10.000
Yes.

25:10.160 --> 25:10.920
My brother is in his office

25:10.920 --> 25:11.790
waiting for you all.

25:11.790 --> 25:12.120
Okay.

25:12.240 --> 25:13.240
We'll go meet him.

25:16.790 --> 25:17.810
Did you go

25:17.960 --> 25:20.290
to Zhou Rong's birthday party
a while ago?

25:21.830 --> 25:22.550
I went to attend

25:22.550 --> 25:24.790
Mr. Rong's birthday party with my brother.

25:24.790 --> 25:26.090
Do you know what your brother was doing

25:26.090 --> 25:26.950
the next night?

25:28.160 --> 25:29.260
Do you mean

25:29.310 --> 25:30.200
the night Mr. Ye

25:30.200 --> 25:31.200
had the accident?

25:31.200 --> 25:31.640
Yes.

25:32.110 --> 25:33.840
You remember it quite clearly.

25:35.030 --> 25:35.720
After all, Mr. Ye was

25:35.720 --> 25:36.920
also like a nice brother to me.

25:36.920 --> 25:37.960
Of course I remember.

25:37.960 --> 25:38.550
Then what was your brother doing

25:38.550 --> 25:39.410
the next night?

25:40.880 --> 25:42.200
L-Let me think.

25:42.200 --> 25:43.200
Go ahead and think.

25:43.200 --> 25:44.000
Socializing,

25:44.240 --> 25:45.070
working overtime,

25:45.070 --> 25:46.110
drinking, going home,

25:46.110 --> 25:46.630
or

25:46.750 --> 25:47.880
hanging out for fun?

25:49.750 --> 25:50.480
Chief Zhang,

25:50.920 --> 25:52.650
what were you doing that night?

25:57.030 --> 25:57.570
Drunk driving.

25:57.570 --> 25:59.110
The citywide DUI crackdown.

25:59.110 --> 25:59.680
Yes, the citywide...

25:59.680 --> 26:00.140
You see,

26:00.270 --> 26:01.000
it's been so long.

26:01.000 --> 26:02.110
Didn't you also need time to recall?

26:02.110 --> 26:03.370
It's human nature.

26:03.430 --> 26:04.830
Have you recalled it now?

26:06.200 --> 26:06.750
That night,

26:06.750 --> 26:08.400
my brother went back home quite early.

26:08.400 --> 26:09.130
He was drunk.

26:09.400 --> 26:10.530
And he didn't drive.

26:10.830 --> 26:11.790
Otherwise, when you checked for DUI,

26:11.790 --> 26:13.720
you'd definitely have caught him.

26:15.510 --> 26:16.110
Yangyang.

26:18.350 --> 26:19.000
Who is Yangyang?

26:19.000 --> 26:20.400
My nickname is Yangyang.

26:21.110 --> 26:21.840
Chief Zhang!

26:22.590 --> 26:23.880
Aren't you here for me?

26:23.900 --> 26:24.750
Why are you standing there chatting?

26:24.750 --> 26:25.790
We ran into each other.

26:25.790 --> 26:27.030
-Chief Zhang, is there anything else?
-Go home, Yangyang.

26:27.030 --> 26:27.760
No, nothing.

26:31.550 --> 26:32.280
Chief Zhang!

26:33.070 --> 26:33.790
Here we meet again.

26:33.790 --> 26:34.160
Yes.

26:34.180 --> 26:35.790
I could've welcomed you downstairs if you
had told me about your visit earlier.

26:35.790 --> 26:36.350
It's fine.

26:36.350 --> 26:37.070
Sorry for the poor reception.

26:37.070 --> 26:37.670
It's fine.

26:39.030 --> 26:39.830
Captain Wang.

26:41.850 --> 26:43.180
-Mr. Lang.
-Officer...

26:43.480 --> 26:45.210
Does this watch look familiar?

26:48.920 --> 26:49.950
It's my watch.

26:50.590 --> 26:52.920
Why are the police
looking into this watch?

26:52.920 --> 26:54.380
I'd like to know that, too.

26:55.070 --> 26:56.270
Why don't you tell me?

27:00.640 --> 27:01.340
Well, I...

27:01.830 --> 27:02.880
I lost it to Yibo when we were

27:02.880 --> 27:03.830
playing a game.

27:04.920 --> 27:06.960
Losing something

27:07.070 --> 27:09.330
to a friend isn't against the law, right?

27:12.030 --> 27:13.380
Did you have this watch

27:14.110 --> 27:15.440
on the day Lu Zheng died?

27:18.720 --> 27:19.580
Wait, Mr. Rong.

27:21.720 --> 27:23.000
Even if the police know

27:23.000 --> 27:24.060
this watch is mine,

27:24.400 --> 27:25.550
they won't link Lu Zheng's case

27:25.550 --> 27:26.740
to us.

27:26.830 --> 27:27.480
That depends

27:27.480 --> 27:29.010
on what you tell the police.

27:30.350 --> 27:30.920
Bowen.

27:32.030 --> 27:32.830
Some money is

27:34.110 --> 27:35.370
not taken for nothing.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.490
It looks very familiar.

27:39.660 --> 27:40.960
This watch is a limited edition.

27:40.960 --> 27:42.290
I have an identical one,

27:42.550 --> 27:44.150
but I gave it to someone else.

27:44.750 --> 27:46.080
Let's sit down and talk.

27:47.400 --> 27:48.480
This

27:49.550 --> 27:50.820
should be my watch.

27:50.920 --> 27:51.400
Really?

27:52.350 --> 27:53.750
You gave it away? To whom?

27:56.880 --> 27:58.680
Whoever you got this watch from,

27:59.110 --> 28:00.370
that's who I gave it to.

28:04.350 --> 28:05.510
We got this

28:05.510 --> 28:06.970
from a fugitive on the run.

28:08.550 --> 28:10.610
Mr. Lang, you have ties to a fugitive?

28:12.160 --> 28:13.300
Wait, officers,

28:13.330 --> 28:14.790
you can't joke about this.

28:14.880 --> 28:16.310
I'm a law-abiding citizen.

28:16.310 --> 28:17.590
How could I possibly have ties

28:17.590 --> 28:18.400
to a fugitive?

28:18.920 --> 28:20.050
Could it be that

28:20.510 --> 28:22.240
the person I gave it to

28:22.400 --> 28:23.880
gave it to someone else?

28:24.680 --> 28:26.340
Even if he didn't give it away,

28:26.510 --> 28:27.710
could he have lost it?

28:28.030 --> 28:29.750
Right? E-Even if it wasn't lost,

28:29.750 --> 28:31.210
it could have been stolen.

28:31.240 --> 28:33.160
Well, there are many possibilities.

28:33.160 --> 28:34.400
It's just that you probably can't remember

28:34.400 --> 28:35.400
who you gave it to.

28:36.400 --> 28:37.350
They all have poor memories.

28:37.350 --> 28:37.790
Yeah.

28:38.550 --> 28:40.610
Do you remember when you gave it away?

28:43.550 --> 28:45.030
It's been a few months.

28:46.070 --> 28:46.510
No,

28:47.000 --> 28:48.060
almost half a year.

28:48.900 --> 28:50.470
Half a year ago, Chief Lu

28:50.590 --> 28:52.030
died in a car accident.

28:52.400 --> 28:53.350
Do you know about this?

28:53.350 --> 28:54.000
Yes, I do.

28:54.880 --> 28:55.880
What a pity.

28:57.680 --> 28:58.550
What?

28:59.310 --> 29:01.320
Is Chief Lu's accidental death

29:01.590 --> 29:02.880
related to this watch?

29:04.160 --> 29:05.420
I say they're related.

29:13.310 --> 29:14.400
The night Chief Lu

29:15.030 --> 29:16.230
had the car accident,

29:16.750 --> 29:18.150
I was indeed at the scene.

29:21.000 --> 29:21.400
Yes.

29:22.200 --> 29:24.260
The watch was on my wrist at that time.

29:25.850 --> 29:26.980
What a coincidence.

29:27.350 --> 29:28.640
When Chief Lu had the accident,

29:28.640 --> 29:29.440
you were right at the scene?

29:29.440 --> 29:30.700
Yes, I was at the scene.

29:30.790 --> 29:32.200
Sanjiangkou is not a big place.

29:32.200 --> 29:34.260
I just happened to pass by that night.

29:35.240 --> 29:36.370
There are security cameras on that road,

29:36.370 --> 29:36.800
right?

29:36.880 --> 29:37.590
Yes, there are.

29:37.590 --> 29:38.160
I see.

29:38.680 --> 29:40.070
You must have seen

29:40.110 --> 29:41.880
this special watch
on the surveillance cameras

29:41.880 --> 29:42.590
and then found out

29:42.590 --> 29:43.680
that the owner of the watch was me,

29:43.680 --> 29:44.680
so you came to ask me,

29:44.680 --> 29:45.080
right?

29:48.550 --> 29:50.290
You were at the scene
of Chief Lu's car accident.

29:50.290 --> 29:50.830
Why didn't you

29:50.830 --> 29:51.790
call the police immediately?

29:51.790 --> 29:54.250
Because someone already called the police.

29:54.750 --> 29:55.720
It's been half a year.

29:55.720 --> 29:59.270
The driver who caused the accident
should've been sentenced, right?

29:59.270 --> 30:01.220
Or did you find out some connection

30:01.250 --> 30:03.510
between the driver and me, Captain Wang?

30:05.510 --> 30:06.910
Is there any connection?

30:09.510 --> 30:10.910
Is there any connection?

30:11.030 --> 30:11.570
Nope.

30:13.000 --> 30:13.660
Well, then,

30:13.830 --> 30:14.610
officers,

30:14.750 --> 30:16.350
if you have any other questions,

30:16.350 --> 30:17.510
I will answer them honestly

30:17.510 --> 30:19.170
and fully cooperate with you.

30:24.240 --> 30:26.000
Do you have any other questions?

30:26.000 --> 30:26.930
I'm done asking.

30:27.510 --> 30:28.370
Then that's it.

30:28.400 --> 30:29.510
We'll find you if there's anything.

30:29.510 --> 30:30.070
Okay.

30:31.240 --> 30:32.430
Won't you sit for a bit longer?

30:32.430 --> 30:33.180
No, thanks.

30:33.680 --> 30:34.310
Then I'll see you out.

30:34.310 --> 30:34.750
Don't bother.

30:34.750 --> 30:35.400
Don't bother seeing us out.

30:35.400 --> 30:36.400
Let me see you out.

30:36.830 --> 30:37.560
Take it slow.

30:41.350 --> 30:42.680
Take care, Chief Zhang.

31:05.030 --> 31:06.270
We didn't get any information out of him.

31:06.270 --> 31:07.670
But you seem quite happy.

31:07.960 --> 31:09.420
The Chief must have a plan.

31:22.960 --> 31:24.640
We asked everything we needed to, right?

31:24.640 --> 31:25.160
We did.

31:26.680 --> 31:28.000
Did we get the results we wanted?

31:28.000 --> 31:28.480
No.

31:31.110 --> 31:32.400
Why can't a non-answer

31:33.510 --> 31:35.110
count as an answer in itself?

31:35.640 --> 31:37.170
What did Lang Bowen answer?

31:46.550 --> 31:46.960
Okay.

31:49.880 --> 31:50.400
The Municipal Bureau

31:50.400 --> 31:51.880
checked Lang Bowen's call records.

31:51.880 --> 31:53.070
On the day of Captain Ye's accident,

31:53.070 --> 31:54.800
he received a call from Lu Yibo.

31:54.880 --> 31:55.620
The call was

31:55.720 --> 31:56.640
made that night

31:56.640 --> 31:57.550
at 9:53 p.m,

31:58.000 --> 31:59.400
which lasted 25 seconds.

32:00.970 --> 32:02.430
Captain Ye must have found

32:02.440 --> 32:04.040
clues about Chief Lu's case.

32:05.200 --> 32:06.800
Lang Bowen was the murderer?

32:07.340 --> 32:08.890
He killed Chief Lu and then

32:09.160 --> 32:10.360
silenced Captain Ye?

32:12.880 --> 32:13.490
So,

32:13.880 --> 32:15.360
Lang Bowen's denial

32:16.070 --> 32:17.270
is also an admission.

32:18.720 --> 32:19.920
What an old fox.

32:20.440 --> 32:22.700
He won't give up until he sees the coffin.

32:23.440 --> 32:24.390
Then,

32:24.630 --> 32:25.960
push him a bit more

32:25.960 --> 32:27.090
towards the coffin.

32:28.080 --> 32:28.790
Ask the bureau

32:28.790 --> 32:30.190
to send cars to pick us up.

32:30.790 --> 32:31.270
Two.

32:35.730 --> 32:37.040
We drove here.

32:37.310 --> 32:39.240
Your car doesn't have that effect.

32:41.550 --> 32:42.810
What's wrong with you?

32:43.590 --> 32:44.760
Were you eavesdropping at the door again?

32:44.710 --> 32:47.770
[Century Otto]

32:45.400 --> 32:46.030
I wasn't.

32:46.070 --> 32:47.800
Then why aren't you going home?

32:52.270 --> 32:52.680
Bowen,

32:53.750 --> 32:54.830
I'm in my 20s.

32:54.830 --> 32:55.680
You can't always

32:55.680 --> 32:56.880
treat me like a child.

32:57.680 --> 32:58.480
No matter what happens,

32:58.480 --> 32:59.350
let's face it together,

32:59.350 --> 32:59.790
okay?

32:59.790 --> 33:00.680
Face what?

33:02.270 --> 33:04.000
You are facing a bright future,

33:04.270 --> 33:05.520
a new life!

33:06.350 --> 33:07.400
I will deal with

33:07.400 --> 33:08.860
this mess in Sanjiangkou.

33:09.240 --> 33:10.110
I can't let you

33:10.110 --> 33:11.240
bear this alone.

33:11.610 --> 33:13.200
The police already found you.

33:13.200 --> 33:13.830
And those things

33:13.830 --> 33:15.560
you did with Mr. Rong before...

33:16.070 --> 33:18.040
What nonsense are you talking about?

33:18.040 --> 33:19.030
Didn't I tell you not to get involved

33:19.030 --> 33:19.960
in our business?

33:24.950 --> 33:27.010
Do you think that's possible, Bowen?

33:27.880 --> 33:28.680
I'm important to you.

33:28.680 --> 33:30.740
But you matter even more to me, Bowen.

33:40.270 --> 33:41.800
Yangyang, you've grown up.

33:45.790 --> 33:46.680
Trust me.

33:47.110 --> 33:48.140
Think carefully.

33:48.270 --> 33:49.510
Since you were little,

33:49.510 --> 33:50.750
have you ever seen me

33:50.750 --> 33:52.200
fail to solve anything?

33:53.030 --> 33:53.630
Have you?

33:54.680 --> 33:55.680
Do you believe me?

33:56.920 --> 33:57.590
Do you?

33:59.550 --> 34:00.750
I believe you, Bowen.

34:03.240 --> 34:05.030
I got a gift for you.

34:06.200 --> 34:08.320
I've wanted to give it to you
for a long time.

34:08.320 --> 34:09.320
What is it, Bowen?

34:14.030 --> 34:15.510
When you are out alone,

34:15.800 --> 34:16.880
especially in a foreign country,

34:16.880 --> 34:17.550
this is

34:17.590 --> 34:18.360
directly related

34:18.360 --> 34:19.760
to your personal safety.

34:23.510 --> 34:24.230
A gun?

34:27.350 --> 34:28.880
[Ultra-thin] [Try-out pack]

34:29.510 --> 34:29.880
Wait, Bowen,

34:29.880 --> 34:31.030
why did you buy these for me?

34:31.030 --> 34:32.070
So you recognize them.

34:32.070 --> 34:32.469
Good.

34:32.489 --> 34:33.820
Then I can rest assured.

34:33.920 --> 34:35.520
You know how to use them, huh?

34:35.760 --> 34:36.850
This is my privacy.

34:37.670 --> 34:39.400
Talking about privacy with me?

34:39.800 --> 34:40.550
Your bare-bottom photos

34:40.550 --> 34:41.670
are still on my phone.

34:41.670 --> 34:42.130
Take it.

34:43.800 --> 34:45.000
Use them sparingly.

34:46.110 --> 34:46.639
Let's go.

34:48.110 --> 34:49.480
Let's tell Mom and Dad the good news.

34:49.480 --> 34:50.190
Let's go.

34:51.070 --> 34:51.510
Wait, wait.

34:51.510 --> 34:52.639
D-Don't bring this.

34:52.840 --> 34:53.320
Right.

34:55.830 --> 35:01.010
[Century Otto]

34:57.150 --> 34:58.030
What happened?

34:58.400 --> 34:59.230
No idea.

34:59.480 --> 35:01.280
Why didn't they arrest that bastard?

35:01.280 --> 35:02.550
It's only a matter of time.

35:02.550 --> 35:04.370
For thugs like him,

35:04.480 --> 35:06.210
even if they become big bosses,

35:06.480 --> 35:08.470
most of them
can't get through an investigation.

35:08.470 --> 35:10.200
Can their background be clean?

35:10.550 --> 35:12.110
You can't put it so absolutely.

35:12.110 --> 35:14.040
Is Lang Bowen definitely a bad guy?

35:14.160 --> 35:15.300
He's so rich now.

35:15.360 --> 35:16.880
Can't he turn over a new leaf?

35:16.880 --> 35:18.470
What if he's helping the police
solve a case?

35:18.470 --> 35:19.400
It's hard to say.

35:20.710 --> 35:22.550
Don't let the masses make random guesses.

35:22.550 --> 35:24.070
Without solid evidence,

35:24.400 --> 35:26.930
the police won't arrest people
for no reason.

35:28.280 --> 35:28.810
Let's go.

35:35.950 --> 35:43.070
[Police]

35:47.710 --> 35:49.000
We got some news from the bank

35:49.000 --> 35:49.840
this morning.

35:50.590 --> 35:52.360
Three days after Chief Lu's accident,

35:52.360 --> 35:53.110
Rongcheng Group

35:53.110 --> 35:54.400
transferred 30 million yuan

35:54.400 --> 35:55.860
to Otto for project funds.

35:58.510 --> 36:00.510
Otto and Rongcheng Group are

36:00.550 --> 36:02.950
in an upstream-downstream relationship.

36:03.000 --> 36:04.060
One acquires land,

36:04.670 --> 36:06.070
one handles demolition.

36:06.150 --> 36:08.550
Their financial transactions are normal.

36:08.630 --> 36:09.840
But wasn't the timing

36:09.840 --> 36:11.170
a bit too coincidental?

36:12.800 --> 36:13.760
That means

36:13.880 --> 36:14.970
this money

36:15.110 --> 36:16.480
might be of other uses.

36:17.110 --> 36:17.840
Possibly.

36:19.710 --> 36:20.710
And possibly not.

36:21.880 --> 36:23.410
We'll find out soon enough.

36:24.000 --> 36:24.760
Officer Song,

36:24.760 --> 36:26.620
the tow truck has arrived at Otto.

36:26.840 --> 36:28.300
Why did you get a tow truck?

36:28.400 --> 36:29.930
Didn't your car break down?

36:32.190 --> 36:32.590
Li Qian,

36:32.590 --> 36:33.780
explain it to him.

36:34.110 --> 36:35.510
We just asked Lang Bowen

36:35.510 --> 36:36.710
about the situation.

36:36.880 --> 36:38.280
He didn't tell us a single shred of truth

36:38.280 --> 36:39.630
and acted very arrogantly.

36:39.630 --> 36:40.560
That's for sure.

36:40.630 --> 36:41.360
People like him

36:41.360 --> 36:42.510
won't give up until he sees the coffin.

36:42.510 --> 36:43.670
So we need you.

36:46.000 --> 36:46.930
What do you mean?

36:47.510 --> 36:48.920
You came to pick us up

36:48.920 --> 36:50.360
so ostentatiously just now.

36:50.360 --> 36:51.490
If Lang Bowen knows,

36:51.710 --> 36:53.440
Zhou Rong will definitely know.

36:53.440 --> 36:54.670
If they have something shady
hidden in their hearts,

36:54.670 --> 36:55.930
they will take action.

36:56.920 --> 36:58.250
This is sowing discord.

36:58.280 --> 36:59.410
As long as they move,

36:59.480 --> 37:00.610
we'll have a chance.

37:00.800 --> 37:02.130
Keep a close eye on them.

37:02.150 --> 37:02.880
Understood.

37:05.110 --> 37:07.110
We don't need the tow truck. Thanks.

37:23.550 --> 37:25.370
Stop running around!

37:25.450 --> 37:27.180
Aren't you tired? Stand still!

37:40.030 --> 37:41.030
Fall!

37:43.630 --> 37:44.840
Fall down!

37:57.720 --> 37:58.660
Can you find

37:58.880 --> 37:59.550
someone less tough

37:59.550 --> 38:00.660
to beat next time?

38:00.920 --> 38:01.440
Okay.

38:01.590 --> 38:03.190
I'll spar with you next time.

38:08.150 --> 38:08.680
Mr. Rong.

38:08.840 --> 38:09.360
What?

38:09.360 --> 38:10.490
It's... It's itchy!

38:15.920 --> 38:16.670
Zhang Yi'ang

38:16.880 --> 38:18.140
went to see Lang Bowen.

38:19.920 --> 38:20.720
Who said that?

38:21.110 --> 38:21.840
Li Penggai.

38:22.360 --> 38:23.360
He saw it with his own eyes

38:23.360 --> 38:24.890
when he was passing by Otto.

38:25.960 --> 38:26.710
What's wrong

38:27.710 --> 38:28.770
with Zhang Yi'ang?

38:29.480 --> 38:30.940
I gave him my business card

38:31.000 --> 38:31.800
and told him to call me

38:31.800 --> 38:33.060
if he needed anything.

38:33.400 --> 38:34.660
But he never called me.

38:35.550 --> 38:36.750
Why is he interacting

38:37.480 --> 38:38.940
with Lu Yibo and Lang Bowen

38:39.070 --> 38:40.000
so often?

38:41.760 --> 38:42.690
What is he doing?

38:44.030 --> 38:44.590
Mr. Rong,

38:45.480 --> 38:46.810
should we do something?

38:47.800 --> 38:49.000
What do you want to do?

38:50.670 --> 38:51.670
Kill someone?

38:52.670 --> 38:54.730
Even a swine wouldn't be this stupid.

38:56.000 --> 38:57.860
There's no need to make a big fuss.

38:58.760 --> 38:59.510
The police

39:00.150 --> 39:01.880
just want to test us right now.

39:02.590 --> 39:04.320
If we do something, we'll make a mistake.

39:04.320 --> 39:05.320
If we do nothing,

39:06.360 --> 39:07.230
we'll be safe.

39:08.110 --> 39:09.450
I'm just worried.

39:09.590 --> 39:10.850
Bowen is an honest man.

39:10.960 --> 39:11.800
If he says anything

39:11.800 --> 39:12.550
unfavorable to you,

39:12.550 --> 39:14.610
wouldn't we be in a passive position?

39:14.670 --> 39:15.150
He...

39:17.630 --> 39:18.630
He wouldn't dare.

39:19.670 --> 39:20.400
Understood.

39:22.550 --> 39:23.270
Mr. Rong,

39:23.550 --> 39:25.710
Li Penggai
made a great contribution this time.

39:25.710 --> 39:26.370
Do you think

39:26.550 --> 39:28.240
we should let him come back?

39:28.840 --> 39:29.700
Where did he go?

39:30.000 --> 39:31.190
He went to transport sand.

39:31.190 --> 39:32.790
Why is he transporting sand?

39:32.880 --> 39:33.630
He's a good boy.

39:33.630 --> 39:34.630
Let him come back.

39:35.360 --> 39:36.070
T-Then I'll just...

39:36.070 --> 39:36.550
Go, go.

39:37.960 --> 39:38.820
Fetch me my bag.

39:39.320 --> 39:39.710
Okay.

39:42.960 --> 39:43.990
Run a few steps.

40:01.670 --> 40:02.150
Hello?

40:03.190 --> 40:03.880
It's me.
